Notes on using ARP for development:
-----------------------------------

The library and .o files in the arppro.zoo archive are 3.6a compatible only,
and cannot be linked with the v5.0 linker.  5.0 compatible bindings have been
provided, however, in the file arpglue3.zoo.  The arpglue3.zoo file is not an
official ARP file or ARP release, but has been kindly provided by developer
Bill Barton (thanx Bill!) to allow ARP development with the Aztec C 5.0
package.


